1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
A Mars base. No doctor. No internet.
Earth is 20 minutes away.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Each astronaut checks in. Their body shows
what needs attention, and what to do about it.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
A camera reads the food shelf. Three boxes gone:
412 days of autonomy become 398.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Cargo is 60 days late?
See what rationing costs before deciding.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,000
A red alert goes to the crew now,
and to Earth with the real delay.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
HESTIA. Health monitoring that still works
when nobody can answer.
